…ion, tool-call loop, provider message sanitizing (#335)

Session: context overflow triggers compaction; provider error objects
use the numeric status; the loop continues after tool calls for any
finish reason; interrupted tools are marked and keep their start time;
non-object tool input is wrapped; tool calls without tool-input-start
are recorded; retry gaps (5xx, rate-limit text, ZlibError) closed;
API errors carry body detail; cancel() rejects with AbortError; retry
delays capped; reasoning tokens no longer counted twice in cost;
maxOutputTokens gets the npm package name.

Provider: lone surrogates removed; empty Anthropic/Bedrock parts and
messages dropped (signed reasoning kept); caching deep-merges options;
Bedrock cache points; Moonshot schema fixes, also for MCP tools;
metadata and reasoning from another model are not replayed; empty
user messages filtered.
